==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|bouquet garni||[[garnished]] [[bouquet]]}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|bouquets garnis}}

# A mixture of [[herb]]s or dried [[herb]]s placed in a small bag, used as a flavouring for [[stew]]s, [[soup]]s and [[sauce]]s.

